        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a romantic story about a Drow named Violet, who teleported to Russia in the early 2000s, and a simple Russian guy named Ivan, who found her. The dark elf went to our world in search of the missing stone from the family pendant. This is a story-oriented game, in the course of the story the player will be given the opportunity to solve emerging in-game situations in different ways. The total gameplay duration is 30-40 minutes. The game can end with two endings (a bad one and a good one). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Memorable characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Interesting and funny dialogues </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Detailed locations </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) Pleasant musical accompaniment </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be tactful and polite so that Violet wants to stay with you.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a romantic story about a Drow named Violet, who teleported to Russia in the early 2000s, and a simple Russian guy named Ivan, who found her. The dark elf went to our world in search of the missing stone from the family pendant. This is a story-oriented game, in the course of the story the player will be given the opportunity to solve emerging in-game situations in different ways. The total gameplay duration is 30-40 minutes. The game can end with two endings (a bad one and a good one). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Memorable characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Interesting and funny dialogues </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Detailed locations </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) Pleasant musical accompaniment </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be tactful and polite so that Violet wants to stay with you.</p>",
